  m_text: "Bear finally reunited with his family at Haven\u2026\none of the last
    places untouched by the infection.\n\nBeyond its walls, the Tumor Roots continued
    to spread\u2026\nand the world outside kept falling into decay.\n\nBut inside
    Haven\u2026\nlife endured."
